{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17169","headline":"古兴 · 权德舆","name":"古兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月中有桂树，无翼难上天。\n海底有龙珠，下隔万丈渊。\n人生大限虽百岁，就中三十称一世。\n晦明乌兔相推迁，雪霜渐到双鬓边。\n沈忧戚戚多浩叹，不得如意居太半。\n一气暂聚常恐散，黄河清兮白石烂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}